 r←Test_Server_419(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;html
⍝ Ask for the licenses the server accepts; pretends to be a Browser
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 html←∆GetHtmlFromServer'[localhost]/v1/get-licenses'
 →T.PassesIf∨/'<h2>Licenses</h2>'⍷html
 →T.PassesIf∨/'<ul class="license-list">'⍷html

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
